---HELP---
bp3 q <quest> diagram - generated graph diagram from the live rollup (mvp.4):
bp3 q <quest> diagram [--format ascii|mermaid|json]   emit the diagram (default ascii)
Nodes carry state and cycle (landed nodes carry exp_fin), deps are drawn once, todo nodes are grouped into ready-set waves, and a blocked node names the dependents it starves. Output is generated at call time from live state; its header carries the rollup timestamp (generated_at). ascii suits terminals and records, mermaid suits rendered docs, json carries the same facts plus both texts for diffing.
Example: bp3 q my-quest diagram --format mermaid
